alue":" , 电流表、电压表示数如图丙所示, 读出此时电流表示数为（填空）mA, 可知电压表的内阻为（填空） "},{"type":"math","value":"\\Omega"},{"type":"text","value":" （保留四位有效数字）。\n（3）实验小组在选择滑动变阻器时，用阻值为 "},{"type":"math","value":"10\\Omega"},{"type":"text","value":" 和 "},{"type":"math","value":"500\\Omega"},{"type":"text","value":" 的两个滑动变阻器分别进行实验，并测出电压表示数 "},{"type":"math","value":"U"},{"type":"text","value":" 和滑片到变阻器左端距离 "},{"type":"math","value":"x"},{"type":"text","value":" ，绘制成图丁表格，图中 "},{"type":"math","value":"a"},{"type":"text","value":" 线代表的是最大阻值为 （填空）（选填“10”或“500”） "},{"type":"math","value":"\\Omega"},{"type":"text","value":" 的滑动变阻器 "},{"type":"math","value":"U-x"},{"type":"text","value":" 图。\n"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/129eddb528ba74bd1d59bee8742e5f6d996f08adc2a3d0101fb472e868ec94b2.png","width":209,"height":241,"width_mm":24.36,"row_group":"jinliqu-shierxiao-gaosan-liankao-2412-q16-row4"},{"type":"text","value":"\n图丁\n（4）若实验测出的合金直径为 "},{"type":"math","value":"d"},{"type":"text","value":" ，长度为 "},{"type":"math","value":"l"},{"type":"text","value":" ，电压表内阻为 "},{"type":"math","value":"R_{V}"},{"type":"text","value":" 。导线 "},{"type":"math","value":"c"},{"type":"text","value":" 与导线 "},{"type":"math","value":"a"},{"type":"text","value":" 相连，闭合开关 "},{"type":"math","value":"S_{1}"},{"type":"text","value":" ，并记录电压表示数 "},{"type":"math","value":"U"},{"type":"text","value":" 和电流表示数 "},{"type":"math","value":"I"},{"type":"text","value":" ，合金电阻率 "},{"type":"math","value":"\\rho ="},{"type":"text","value":"（填空）（用题中字母和"},{"type":"math","value":"\\pi"},{"type":"text","value":"表示）。"}],"choices":[],"answer":{"status":"source","key":null,"body":[{"type":"text","value":"16.（14分）\nI（1）B（2分）    （2）A（2分）\nⅡ（1）CD（2分）    （2）"},{"type":"math","value":"\\frac{hcl}{d\\Delta x}"},{"type":"text","value":"（1分）\nⅢ（1）2.325（1分）    （2）a（1分） 0.90（1分） 2667（1分）\n(3) 10（1分）    （4）"},{"type":"math","value":"\\frac{\\pi d^{2}UR_{V}}{4l(IR_{V}-U)}"},{"type":"text","value":"（2分）"}]}},{"id":"zj-25-shoukao--jinliqu-shierxiao-gaosan-liankao-2412-q17","paper_id":"zj-25-shoukao--jinliqu-shierxiao-gaosan-liankao-2412","source_question_id":"jinliqu-shierxiao-gaosan-liankao-2412-q17","number":"17","order":17,"type":"计算题","topics":["热学"],"answer_status":"source","fingerprint":"0ed881d6217af2ebae8b480cdd7d04b437208eb252e6e19bb4c26e4151686ba1","body":[{"type":"text","value":"17.（8分）如图甲所示，导热良好的汽缸内用面积 "},{"type":"math","value":"S=100cm^{2}"},{"type":"text","value":" 、质量m=2kg的活塞封闭一定质量的理想气体，气柱的长度为L=18cm，活塞能无摩擦滑动。现将汽缸顺时针缓慢转动90°使其开口端水平向右如图乙，不计活塞厚度，汽缸足够长且不漏气，大气压强 "},{"type":"math","value":"p_{0}=1.01\\times10^{5}Pa"},{"type":"text","value":" ，g取 "},{"type":"math","value":"10m/s^{2}"},{"type":"text","value":" 。\n（1）此过程中缸内气体的内能（填空）（选填“增大”“减小”或“不变”）；单位时间内气体分子碰撞活塞的次数（填空）（填“变多”、“变少”或“不变”）。\n"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/032192ad3a3d996d2fac90bd83dc76efccef85c710d095d37caf81ca6af4860d.png","width":151,"height":195,"width_mm":17.64,"row_group":"jinliqu-shierxiao-gaosan-liankao-2412-q17-row1"},{"type":"text","value":"\n图甲\n"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/73f02b8396ed434bbf46079a18d0bf97f9abbc83039509a9756f6d6c9bb9d061.png","width":217,"height":198,"width_mm":25.41,"row_group":"jinliqu-shierxiao-gaosan-liankao-2412-q17-row1"},{"type":"text","value":"\n图乙\n"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/332e3255367298b8ab97f5cb4cd95f46c5b9ef14dd464e3470f5bb8454328ebd.png","width":391,"height":256,"width_mm":45.78,"row_group":"jinliqu-shierxiao-gaosan-liankao-2412-q17-row1"},{"type":"text","value":"\n图丙\n(2) 现将汽缸固定在倾角为 "},{"type":"math","value":"\\theta = 30^{\\circ}"},{"type":"text","value":" 斜面上, 如图丙, 求活塞稳定后封闭气柱的长度。\n（3）降低丙图中的气体温度，使活塞缓慢回到甲图位置，若气体释放了 40J 的热量，求气体内能的变化量。"}],"choices":[],"answer":{"status":"source","key":null,"body":[{"type":"text","value":"17.（8分）【详解】\n（1）因汽缸导热良好，稳定后汽缸内气体温度不变，由于理想气体内能只与温度有关，所以气体内能不变；\n开始时气体的压强"},{"type":"math","value":"p_{1}=p_{0}+\\frac{mg}{S}=1.03\\times10^{5}Pa"},{"type":"text","value":"旋转"},{"type":"math","value":"90^{\\circ}"},{"type":"text","value":"后气体的压强"},{"type":"math","value":"p_{2}=p_{0}=1.01\\times10^{5}Pa"},{"type":"text","value":"容器内气体的压强减小，单位时间内气体分子碰撞活塞的次数变少。（每空1分，共2分）\n(2) 以活塞为研究对象, 根据共点力平衡条件有"},{"type":"math","value":"p_{0}S = p_{3}S + mg\\sin\\theta"},{"type":"text","value":"……1 分\n解得"},{"type":"math","value":"p_{3} = 1.00 \\times 10^{5}\\text{Pa}"},{"type":"text","value":"……1 分\n设乙图中图中封闭气柱的长度为 L, 由玻意耳定律有"},{"type":"math","value":"p_{1}SL = p_{3}SL_{3}"},{"type":"text","value":"……1 分\n解得"},{"type":"math","value":"L_{3} = 18.54\\text{cm}"},{"type":"text","value":"……1 分\n(3) 外界对气体做功为"},{"type":"math","value":"W = p_{3}(L_{3} - L)S"},{"type":"text","value":"解得\nW=5.4J....1分\n根据热力学第一定律"},{"type":"math","value":"\\Delta U=W+Q"},{"type":"text","value":"解得"},{"type":"math","value":"\\Delta U=-34.6J"},{"type":"text","value":"....1分\n即气体内能减少了34.6J"}]}},{"id":"zj-25-shoukao--jinliqu-shierxiao-gaosan-liankao-2412-q18","paper_id":"zj-25-shoukao--jinliqu-shierxiao-gaosan-liankao-2412","source_question_id":"jinliqu-shierxiao-gaosan-liankao-2412-q18","number":"18","order":18,"type":"计算题","topics":["力学"],"answer_status":"source","fingerprint":"429df661bf6366a3db4c2120be0c496e9bdee193da98d7ec314dd4cf167c5f94","body":[{"type":"text","value":"18. (11 分) 某轨道模型如图所示, "},{"type":"math","value":"AB"},{"type":"text","value":" 为弧形轨道, 在 "},{"type":"math","value":"B"},{"type":"text","value":" 处与水平轨道 "},{"type":"math","value":"BH"},{"type":"text","value":" 平滑相接。 "},{"type":"math","value":"CDE"},{"type":"text","value":" 为半径 "},{"type":"math","value":"R = 0.1 \\mathrm{~m}"},{"type":"text","value":" 的圆形轨道, "},{"type":"math","value":"C, E"},{"type":"text","value":" 略微错开。 "},{"type":"math","value":"FG"},{"type":"text","value":" 段为以 "},{"type":"math","value":"v_{0} = 3 \\mathrm{~m} / \\mathrm{s}"},{"type":"text","value":" 顺时针旋转的长度 "},{"type":"math","value":"L_{1} = 2 \\mathrm{~m}"},{"type":"text","value":" 的传送带。水平轨道末端 "},{"type":"math","value":"H"},{"type":"text","value":" 处放置长度 "},{"type":"math","value":"L_{2} = 2 \\mathrm{~m}"},{"type":"text","value":" , 质量 "},{"type":"math","va